{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02064","headline":"杂曲歌辞 鹧鸪词 二 · 李涉","name":"杂曲歌辞 鹧鸪词 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越冈连越井，越鸟更南飞。\n何处鹧鸪嗁，夕烟东岭归。\n岭头行人少，天涯北客稀。\n鹧鸪嗁别处，相对泪沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}